{"id":"n0f580f3aec","headline":"Tanker struck by three projectiles exiting Strait of Hormuz, UKMTO warns","summary":"UKMTO reported that a tanker was struck by three unknown projectiles about 17 nautical miles east of Khasab, Oman, while outbound through the Strait of Hormuz. No casualties were reported.","why":"The Strait of Hormuz carries a large share of global seaborne oil, so attacks on tankers there can disrupt energy supply and raise shipping risk premiums.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Khasab","country":"Oman","lat":26.18,"lon":56.25,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"investingLive","url":"https://investinglive.com/commodities/tanker-struck-by-three-projectiles-exiting-strait-of-hormuz-ukmto-warns/"},"sources":[{"name":"investingLive","url":"https://investinglive.com/commodities/tanker-struck-by-three-projectiles-exiting-strait-of-hormuz-ukmto-warns/"}],"published_at":"2026-08-31T23:04:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"40fef638bbf8f59e","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Attacks on a tanker in the Strait of Hormuz raise concern about disruption to Gulf oil shipments.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-31T23:04:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-01T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"MU","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-5227404.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"papazachariasa","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/ship-oil-sea-ocean-sky-water-5227404/"}}